n Ahmedabad ranges between \u20b920,000 to \u20b91,50,000, depending on course type, duration, institute reputation, and whether it includes certifications or placement support.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1775554416584\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">3. Do IT courses in Ahmedabad provide placement assistance?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Yes, many IT training institutes in Ahmedabad provide placement assistance, including resume building, mock interviews, job referrals, and direct interview opportunities with companies after course completion.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1775554429627\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">4. What is the duration of IT training programs in Ahmedabad?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">IT training programs in Ahmedabad usually range from 3 to 12 months, depending on course complexity, learning mode, and whether it includes advanced topics or project-based training.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1775554446918\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">5. Are there flexible timings for IT classes in Ahmedabad for working professionals?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Yes, many institutes offer flexible timings, such as weekend or evening batches, making it easier for working professionals and students to manage learning along with their daily schedules.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1775554463942\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">6. What eligibility criteria are required for IT courses in Ahmedabad?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Most IT courses in Ahmedabad require basic computer knowledge, while advanced courses may need an understanding of programming or a graduation in a related field, depending on the course level.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1775554479807\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">7. How c